 Description:
+        DEPRECATED, WILL BE REMOVED SOON
 		Set the Slow Package Power Tracking Limit of CPU: PL2 on Intel, SPPT,
 		on AMD. Shown on Intel+Nvidia or AMD+Nvidia based systems:
 
@@ -160,6 +170,7 @@ Date:		Jun 2023
